WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.230
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.360
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.110
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.940
Shining Finger

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.820
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.660
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:26.330
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.590
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.010
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:48.350
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.650
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.150
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.240
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.240
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.000
Bright you now

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:10.840
Shining Finger

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.500
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.050
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:29.310
Space Colony
Neo Japan

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:34.030
Yeah, what is it?

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:36.690
Don't you know it's night
here at the Colony?

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:38.990
Show some consideration.

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:40.910
What?!
The Devil Gundam?!

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:42.620
Yes, sir.

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:45.870
Recently, we've been
losing contact...

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:48.210
...with our intelligence
personnel on Earth.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:49.540
And in every case...

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:53.500
...their last words made reference
to a devil-like Gundam.

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:56.850
And the location of the
distress call we received is...

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:04.510
That's...!

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:05.970
That's Shinjuku!

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:07.390
Yes, sir.

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:09.390
It is only on Earth, I realize...

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:12.480
...but we cannot ignore a distress
coming from our own nation.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:13.980
Of course we can't!

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:17.360
Therefore, we'd like to use the
services of Domon Kasshu again.

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:18.540
I understand.

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:20.550
I'll have him head to
Shinjuku at once!

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.000
Now...

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.260
...as you've just heard...

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:40.970
...today's story takes place
on Earth, in Shinjuku.

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.800
But amidst this demolished city...

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:46.510
...Domon will have
a chance meeting...

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:50.640
...which will make it more difficult
for him to escape his destiny.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:52.340
Also...

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:55.480
Domon enters a death match
with a mysterious...

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:57.900
...mobile suit force,
the Death Army.

00:02:58.190 --> 00:02:59.780
And now!

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:04.370
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:10.370
He's the Undefeated of the East!
Master Asia Appears

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:26.430
This time around it looks like
Ulube's information is accurate.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:29.020
Do you think the
Devil Gundam could be here?

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:30.350
I'm not sure.

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:31.730
What I do know is that...

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.730
...the damage to this city
is not normal.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:38.360
Duck!

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:40.490
We're being chased?!

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.790
He can't get out!
He's unconscious!

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:50.440
Be careful, Rain!

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:07.760
You're from outside the city,
right?

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:08.720
Then, please...

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:10.600
Scouted...

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:13.180
Number of enemies...

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:16.270
Information to allies...

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:19.750
He's out.

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:21.900
Look there, Domon.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.540
That building's the only one
with its lights on.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.030
Why is that?

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:31.080
Quiet!

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:33.370
I believe we're surrounded.

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.260
Listen...

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:53.010
...call for the Lander
when I tell you.

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:56.520
Now!

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:04.860
We made it.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:05.860
But, Domon...!

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:19.750
They're pursuing!

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.010
In that case...

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:26.840
Gundam!

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.200
Hold it!

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.900
Keep Gundam activity
to a minimum here!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:39.560
What?

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:41.690
Keep moving, Domon Kasshu!

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.400
How do you know me?

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:44.650
I'm borrowing this!

00:05:58.370 --> 00:05:59.580
Incredible...

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:00.960
I've seen that technique.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:30.820
Over here!

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:47.050
I knew it! It is him!

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:57.970
Undefeated of the East,
Master Asia?!

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:02.440
You mean your Master?
The martial arts expert...

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:04.700
...and former King of Hearts?

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:08.540
But what could he be doing here?

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:14.570
Behind you!

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:35.600
Wh-what's going on?

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:37.310
Mobile suits battling it out?

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:42.020
Where'd he go?

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:44.480
Where are you looking?

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:47.570
I'm up here! Right up here!

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:53.490
Master!

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:57.240
Answer me, Domon!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.160
The school of the...

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:00.830
...Undefeated of the East!

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.460
The winds of the king!

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:03.580
Zenshin!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:04.750
Keiretsu!

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:07.250
Tempa Kyoran!

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:13.550
Look!
The East is burning red!

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.440
How have you been, Domon?

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:29.190
Or rather, the man I acknowledge
as the King of Hearts.

00:08:34.920 --> 00:08:37.120
M-master...

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:40.410
I've been longing to see you!

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:42.750
What's wrong?

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:45.580
Why would a grown man
like you be crying?

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:05.440
Your mother died and your father
was sentenced to a cryogenic state.

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:07.310
I see.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.940
A lot has happened
since I left you.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:12.730
I had no knowledge of this.

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:13.880
Yes.

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:15.900
I'm ashamed to say...

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:17.860
...that I became a Fighter
because of that...

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:21.040
...and have been pursuing
my brother with my Gundam.

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:23.080
You know, Domon...

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:28.790
...I can see that, as master and pupil,
our destinies are bound together.

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:33.840
You see, the reason I also
happen to be here...

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:37.180
...has to do with that
Devil Gundam you refer to.

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:40.890
Look!
This is Tokyo now!

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:44.970
This city, once the center of
a great economic power...

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:47.600
...is now reduced to ruins,
except for this one building.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:50.400
Those seeking help gather here...

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:53.940
...at the Metropolitan Government
building.

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:55.940
They tremble in fear every day.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:58.280
And it's all because of them.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.910
The Death Army,
which appears without warning.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:04.790
And the mysterious giant Gundam
that controls them.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:08.000
Likely what you call
the Devil Gundam.

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:12.630
As you very well know...

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:15.170
...as the champion from
the previous Gundam Fight...

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:19.720
...I'm participating again
as Neo Hong Kong's Fighter.

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:22.890
An opponent challenged me
to a match here at this building.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:25.110
However, it was a trap.

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:32.230
This man not only attacked me...

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.940
...but began to systematically
destroy this city.

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:40.240
Finally, he disappeared
without a trace...

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:44.330
...and the few that remain are
using defensive mobile suits...

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:47.750
...as weapons to protect this fort.

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.920
There's enough food
and electrical power...

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:53.330
...stored here to last us
for some time.

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.260
But the problem is...

00:10:57.260 --> 00:11:00.510
...whether or not the people can
endure these conditions.

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:01.720
Master!

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:02.510
What's wrong?

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:05.300
One of our mobile suits
is going AWOL!

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:06.760
What?!

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:13.150
What do you think you're doing?!

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:15.730
I can't stand being here any longer!

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:17.440
We're just going to get killed!

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:18.610
I'm out of here!

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:19.860
Wait!

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:24.700
You idiot!

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:33.290
It's as you see.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:36.500
Even the guards succumb to this.

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:39.240
The fear pushes them
past the breaking point.

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:41.220
Domon!

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:45.390
I need all the help I can get.

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:47.970
Won't you consider
joining our fight?

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:53.190
Yes.
The Undefeated of the East...

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:55.660
Master Asia is asking you.

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:04.820
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:25.510
How could something
like this happen?

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:26.470
Sure, Master.

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:27.390
Please.

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:28.430
Over here.

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:31.520
Domon?

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:39.860
This is your...

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.030
Yes.

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:43.840
I used it in the previous
Gundam Fight.

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:45.120
This is the Kowloon Gundam.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:47.010
You like it?

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:49.280
It's a bit old but still
quite powerful.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:52.500
But my Shining Gundam
is pretty powerful, too.

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:54.500
What a guy.

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:58.750
You think you're some
kind of tough guy now, huh?

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:07.340
Domon...

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:09.760
I don't think I've ever
seen him look so happy.

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:15.100
Emergency! Emergency!

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:17.650
All defense personnel,
proceed to intelligence center!

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:18.770
Emergency!

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.780
You mean those lights
are all enemy units?!

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:31.990
They must be planning an
all-out attack on this building!

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:33.610
Oh, boy...

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:34.620
Do not worry.

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:37.330
You can leave everything to me.

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:42.210
This includes data on
the enemy units.

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.800
A comrade risked his life
to get this to us.

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:47.760
According to this...

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:51.260
...the enemy will concentrate
its attack on this one point.

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:54.180
It will likely head
straight toward us.

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:56.930
We can't defend ourselves
against that!

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:57.940
We can.

00:13:57.940 --> 00:14:00.900
We take advantage of their
program predictability.

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:02.750
First, as a safeguard...

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:06.570
...we surround this vicinity
with our defensive mobile suits.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.380
What's important...

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:11.490
...is that we ignore all Death Army
soldiers coming into the area.

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:13.390
The reason...

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:17.400
...is that they're very sensitive to
hostile actions against themselves.

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:19.960
In the meantime,
my unit will launch an attack...

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:22.960
...while luring them
in the opposite direction...

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:25.460
...and out to sea.

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.550
In other words...

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:29.930
...the Pied Piper of Hamelin.

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:34.560
Hold on!

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:37.680
Not all of us are
fearless fighters like you!

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:39.440
Why should we...?!

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.140
You fool!

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:43.320
We're just sitting back
waiting to perish.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:45.320
We must do something right now.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.900
Only those with the
courage to fight join me!

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:49.070
Got that?!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.990
All units, follow Master!

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:56.230
Those remaining will provide cover!

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:58.040
Stay close, Domon.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.500
Try not to fall behind.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:02.810
My Shining Gundam and I
are proud to join you.

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:08.840
All units!
Are you prepared to take off?!

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:11.680
Commence operations!

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:21.770
You dare get in my way?!

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:33.640
Forget the ones below!

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:35.370
Crush only the reinforcements!

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:49.730
Commence attack!

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:50.510
Right, Master!

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:14.530
How many are there?!

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:15.700
Domon!

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:19.290
There's no end to this if we
fight them one at a time.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:21.870
Why don't we try this?

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:22.750
Right!

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.670
Chokyu!

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:26.180
Haow!

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.880
Den-eidan!

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:32.510
Chokyu!
Haow!
Den-eidan!

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:36.930
Domon! Launch me!

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:37.930
Yes, sir!

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:51.150
Explode!

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:57.030
The enemy forces
are changing direction!

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:59.490
So far the operation's
working as planned!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:02.160
Good work, Domon.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:07.670
What's that?!

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:26.310
The Death Army's made it in here!

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:36.990
It's come in this close...

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:40.450
If only this had happened
when Master Asia was around!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:41.450
Mayor!

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:44.330
This is no time to be losing heart!

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:47.670
Hurry and escort the
people to safety!

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:48.670
Just got word.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:51.250
- One of our guards is moving in!
- What?!

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:59.050
Only one. I'll take him!

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:00.300
Don't shoot!

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:01.140
You can't!

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:03.470
If we show signs of hostility,
it'll call for help!

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:06.020
I'll blow it up before
it gets the chance!

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:10.860
How's that?!

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:19.240
Wh-what the...?

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.160
That sound couldn't be...?!

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:41.800
All right.

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:44.010
All we do now is lure them away.

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:09.460
What's the matter?

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:12.040
It seems there's something
calling them back.

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:14.250
The Government Building!

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:16.960
Domon, leave these to me.

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:19.080
Get back to the city...

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:21.300
...and get rid of the sound
that's calling them!

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:22.890
Yes, Master!

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:27.720
Now...

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:31.770
L-look!

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:33.150
They're heading back this way!

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:41.040
What?

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:07.010
Domon!

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:10.220
I'm not going to let you guys
get any closer!

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:12.940
The ultimate!

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:18.190
Shining Finger!

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:23.450
And now I've won!

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:37.710
Reporting!

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:40.960
Enemy troops are withdrawing!
Our operation is a success!

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:44.050
H-have we all been saved?

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.750
What in the world are these?

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:02.110
Domon!

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:04.070
That's my pupil!

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:06.820
You allowed me to get rid
of the enemy troops!

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:10.280
No. This is all thanks to your plan,
Master.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:13.410
Now, come on.

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:16.090
The reason we succeeded
was because you...!

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:19.880
Domon! Behind you!

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:25.510
What's that?!

00:21:31.510 --> 00:21:33.470
It's the DG cells!

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:35.440
This has to do
with the Devil Gundam!

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:47.070
Same thing...

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:48.990
We saw this with
Dahal and Saette.

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:52.330
Which means...

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:06.010
I'm sure of it now!

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:09.390
The Devil Gundam isn't
far from here!

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:13.060
I've finally cornered him!

00:22:28.110 --> 00:22:32.740
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:37.120
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.410 --> 00:22:41.580
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:45.130
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.420 --> 00:22:52.300
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:58.020
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.230 --> 00:23:03.270
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:09.820
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:13.950
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.120 --> 00:23:19.960
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:34.510 --> 00:23:36.390
Everybody, this is unbelievable!

00:23:36.760 --> 00:23:40.180
Chibodee, Sai Saici, George,
and Argo.

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:43.810
Domon's rivals have all
acquired incredible powers.

00:23:43.810 --> 00:23:47.280
Moreover, a mysterious
Gundam has joined them.

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:50.030
And together they attack Domon!

00:23:50.650 --> 00:23:53.110
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:53.110 --> 00:23:56.450
Big Trouble! Domon vs. Big 5

00:23:54.370 --> 00:24:01.120
Big Trouble!
Domon vs. Big 5

00:23:56.450 --> 00:23:59.080
Ready! Go!
